"The '`@llvm.nvvm.cp.async.bulk.tensor.g2s.*`' and '`@llvm.nvvm.cp.async.bulk."
"tensor.g2s.cta.*`' intrinsics, including the property-override forms, take "
"an `i32 %flag_valid_pattern` immediate argument in the range \\[0, 6). The "
"non-tensor '`@llvm.nvvm.cp.async.bulk.global.to.shared.cluster`', '`@llvm."
"nvvm.cp.async.bulk.global.to.shared.cluster.relaxed`', '`@llvm.nvvm.cp.async."
"bulk.global.to.shared.cta`', and '`@llvm.nvvm.cp.async.bulk.global.to.shared."
"cta.relaxed`' intrinsics also take the same `i32 %flag_valid_pattern` "
"immediate argument. It selects the data-validity reporting mechanism applied "
"to the data while it is copied:"
