"When the reporting mechanism is not specified, it defaults to disabled, "
"which emits no qualifier in the PTX instruction and maintains compatibility "
"with older PTX versions. For values 1 through 5, the associated mbarrier "
"must be initialized with `layout::v1` layout; otherwise, the behavior is "
"undefined."
