#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:3349
msgid "'`llvm.nvvm.tensormap.replace.global.stride`'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:3360
msgid ""
"The '`@llvm.nvvm.tensormap.replace.global.stride.*`' intrinsics replace the "
"`%ord`-th element of the `global_stride` field of the tensor-map object with "
"`%new_value`. `%ord` must be in the range [0, 4]."
