#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:4591
msgid "Warp-level Matrix Transpose Intrinsics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:4593
msgid "'`llvm.nvvm.movmatrix.sync.aligned.m8n8.trans.b16`'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:4603
msgid ""
"The '`@llvm.nvvm.movmatrix.sync.aligned.m8n8.trans.b16`' intrinsic "
"transposes an 8x8 matrix of 16-bit elements distributed across all 32 "
"threads of a warp. Each thread provides a 32-bit register containing two "
"packed `.b16` elements, and receives back two packed `.b16` elements from "
"the transposed matrix in the same format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:4609
msgid ""
"The mandatory `.sync` qualifier indicates that `movmatrix` causes the "
"executing thread to wait until all threads in the warp execute the same "
"`movmatrix` intrinsic before resuming execution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:4613
msgid ""
"The mandatory `.aligned` qualifier indicates that all threads in the warp "
"must execute the same `movmatrix` intrinsic. In conditionally executed code, "
"a `movmatrix` intrinsic should only be used if it is known that all threads "
"in the warp evaluate the condition identically, otherwise the behavior is "
"undefined."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:4619
msgid ""
"For more information, refer to the [PTX ISA](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/"
"parallel-thread-execution/index.html#warp-level-matrix-instructions-"
"movmatrix)."
msgstr ""

